ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603192304467157_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603192304467157_720.jpg"> </div><p>【欧联、欧协8强】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc77823839fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">25-26赛季欧联八强：罗马出局！博洛尼亚将战维拉，波尔图碰森林</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/69bc8c5451d65.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/69bc8c5451d65.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/69bc8c5451d65.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">欧联杯1/8决赛次回合的较量已经全部结束，本赛季的欧联八强也正式出炉。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc76ee33c93native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧协联1/4决赛对阵：水晶宫vs佛罗伦萨，美因茨vs斯特拉斯堡</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260320/202603200635458600.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260320/202603200635458600.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260320/202603200635458600.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">欧协联1/8决赛战罢，1/4决赛对阵出炉。</span></p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/match1931850date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进欧联八强！维拉2-0总比分3-0里尔 麦金、贝利破门桑乔送助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931850_1773956781_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931850_1773956781_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931850_1773956781_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">维拉主场2-0战胜里尔，总比分3-0淘汰对手晋级欧联八强。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/match1931849date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘欧联八强！罗马加时3-4博洛尼亚 恩迪卡破门+送礼马伦点射</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931849_1773959722_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931849_1773959722_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931849_1773959722_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">罗马3-4博洛尼亚总比分4-5无缘欧联八强，博洛尼亚八强将战维拉。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/match1931848date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进欧联八强！森林3-0点胜中日德兰晋级 中日德兰点球大战三罚全失</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931848_1773952370_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931848_1773952370_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931848_1773952370_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">诺丁汉森林点球大战3-0中日德兰晋级八强，将对阵波尔图和斯图加特之间的胜者。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/match1931869date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">将战佛罗伦萨！水晶宫加时2-1九人AEK拉纳卡进欧协联8强 萨尔双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931869_1773952200_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931869_1773952200_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260320/zhanbao_image_1931869_1773952200_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">水晶宫在客场以2-1击败AEK拉纳卡，以总比分2-1淘汰对手杀进了欧协联八强，将在1/4决赛对阵佛罗伦萨。</span></p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc569d083c8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大改！美职联官方：2027年初举行短赛季，夏季起正式改为跨年赛程</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200405431924_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200405431924_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200405431924_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">美职联官方公告，宣布2027年初开始的新赛季将是短赛季，从2027年夏天开始，美职联的赛制将和欧洲主流联赛同步，变成跨年赛程。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-19/69bbef1764cc1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">内鬼找到了！罗塞尼尔：查到了是谁泄露的首发，已经处理过了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.9" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603192159402022.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.9" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.9" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603192159402022_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603192159402022_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">切尔西主帅罗塞尼尔出席对阵埃弗顿的赛前发布会，在发布会上，罗塞尼尔回应了切尔西首发遭遇泄露的问题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc450578612native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不禁赛！FIFA官方：以色列足协罚款15万瑞士法郎，并需展示横幅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220331/62455dbe04557.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220331/62455dbe04557.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220331/62455dbe04557.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">FIFA官方公告，就巴勒斯坦此前提出的提案做出回应，以色列足协被罚款15万瑞士法郎，并需在球场内展示反歧视横幅。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc702201ddfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超9队参加欧战最终5队晋级：欧冠4队出局 维拉水晶宫森林均晋级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200612418206.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200612418206_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200612418206_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">欧联杯1/8决赛和欧协联1/8决赛次回合，维拉、水晶宫、诺丁汉森林分别淘汰各自对手挺进八强。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc2c188cb28native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">镜报：曼联将拒巴萨续租拉师傅提议！掏钱或送他回来，夏窗卖别家</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260208/69878434ad9e7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260208/69878434ad9e7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260208/69878434ad9e7.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">镜报的最新报道，曼联将拒绝巴萨对拉什福德再租借一个赛季的提议。曼联会要求巴萨支付此前商定的2600万英镑转会费，否则就要在夏窗把他带回曼彻斯特，随后出售给其他买家。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-19/69bc1ca9a7a7anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">别想！英媒：纽卡坚决否认与曼联谈吉马良斯，托纳利等大将也不卖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231016/652cfdf1a623e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231016/652cfdf1a623e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231016/652cfdf1a623e.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">TEAMtalk消息，纽卡已坚决否认关于就布鲁诺·吉马良斯的潜在交易与曼联或任何其他俱乐部进行过任何谈判的说法，并且他们将与该中场球员就一份破纪录的新合同进行谈判。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc63f8d02f7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">跟队：阿根廷世界杯前友谊赛全部泡汤！可寻找的潜在对手已不多了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603190125147482.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603190125147482_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260319/202603190125147482_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">阿根廷跟队记者埃杜最新的报道，阿根廷在世界杯前所有友谊赛安排均已取消，目前来看他们原本安排在北京时间4月1日对阵危地马拉的友谊赛可能已经告吹。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bc5d8f0d94bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">来拿拿看？塞内加尔拒绝归还非洲杯，还将奖杯送进军事基地保护</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200437289415.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200437289415.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260320/202603200437289415.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">奥莱报消息，塞内加尔在非洲足联的裁定公布后拒绝归还非洲杯，不仅如此，他们还更进一步把奖杯保护起来了。</span></p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px; 